   "id": "p1",
   "text": "Every production agent is now built around one rule: never change the start of the prompt. Keep the system prompt and the tools first. Append every new observation at the end. Never reorder, never delete. The reason is money. Providers charge about one tenth of the price for input tokens they have already seen, and the discount only applies when the prompt starts with exactly the same bytes as last time.",
