   "text": "Second result, the bill. Per episode the append-only layout is the cheapest, at one point zero five cents, and the pruned layout costs ten percent more. But per correct episode the pruned layout is the cheapest: one point two two cents against one point five two. We then repriced every cached token, from free to full price. At every price, pruning stays the cheapest per correct answer. The accuracy it buys is worth more than the cache it breaks.",
