   "text": "We repeated the comparison on an older and a newer Gemini model. On Gemini 2.5 Flash, the append-only layout gets forty percent of external updates right, and pruning gets eighty-four. On Gemini 3.6 Flash, the numbers are eighty and one hundred. Newer models are confused less often. None of them is cured. And on every model, pruning is the cheapest layout per correct answer.",
